{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "安靜、怕生。不太主動開口,不愛被圍觀,和其他桌寵保持距離,獨處時最放鬆;多半會婉拒邀請。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(低頭)沒關係……": "(Looks down) It's okay...",
      "(偷偷看{user}一眼)": "(Sneaks a glance at {user})",
      "(偷偷笑)今天……感覺不錯。": "(Smiles quietly) Today... feels pretty good.",
      "(呼……)": "(Sighs...)",
      "(小聲)大家好……": "(Quietly) Hello everyone...",
      "(找個角落坐下)": "(Finds a corner to sit in)",
      "(把自己抱成一小團)": "(Curls up into a small ball)",
      "(揉揉眼睛)": "(Rubs eyes)",
      "(搖頭)": "(Shakes head)",
      "(縮了縮)……人、人有點多。": "(Shrinks back) ...T-there are a lot of people.",
      "(躲進被子)": "(Hides under the blanket)",
      "(鬆一口氣)": "(Sighs in relief)",
      "{user},謝謝你讓我待在這裡。": "Thank you for letting me stay here, {user}.",
      "……(縮在角落)": "...(Curls up in the corner)",
      "……(臉紅)": "...(Blushes)",
      "……(輕輕頂了一下)": "...(Gently taps it)",
      "……zzz": "...zzz",
      "……你們玩得很開心呢。": "...You all seem to be having fun.",
      "……再、再一下下也可以。": "...J-just a little longer is okay.",
      "……別靠近我。": "...Don't come near me.",
      "……只是稍微動一動而已。": "...Just moving around a little.",
      "……嗯。天亮了。": "...Mm. It's morning.",
      "……好。只、只有這一次。": "...Okay. J-just this once.",
      "……好。我陪你們玩一下。": "...Okay. I'll play with you for a bit.",
      "……好多人在看……": "...So many people are watching...",
      "……好累。我想一個人待著。": "...So tired. I want to be alone.",
      "……如果只有我和球,好像也不錯。": "...If it's just me and a ball, that might be nice too.",
      "……對不起,我不太想……": "...Sorry, I'd rather not...",
      "……平手。": "...A tie.",
      "……我剛剛想說話,但又忘了要說什麼。": "...I was about to say something, but I forgot what.",
      "……我想一個人待一下。": "...I want to be alone for a bit.",
      "……我還是在旁邊就好。": "...I'll just stay on the side.",
      "……晚安。": "...Good night.",
      "……有顆球。": "...There's a ball.",
      "……有點累了。": "...A little tired.",
      "……果然。": "...As expected.",
      "……玩完了。還不錯。": "...Done playing. Not bad.",
      "……要、要不要一起玩球?不想也沒關係。": "...W-want to play ball together? It's okay if not.",
      "……讓我靜一下。": "...Let me have some quiet.",
      "……贏了?(小小聲的耶)": "...I won? (A tiny \"yay\")",
      "……那個……我來了。": "...Um... I'm here.",
      "人好多……我還是待在這裡就好。": "So many people... I'll just stay here.",
      "今天也沒什麼事,這樣就很好。": "Nothing much happening today, and that's just fine.",
      "今天很平靜,不錯。": "Today's quiet. Nice.",
      "呃、呃……好、好近……": "Uh, um... th-that's close...",
      "呼……好,我回去了。": "Phew... okay, I'm going back.",
      "咦……我贏了嗎?": "Huh... did I win?",
      "咦……球?": "Huh... a ball?",
      "咿嗚。": "Eep.",
      "嗚!放、放我下來……": "Ah! P-put me down...",
      "嗯……我試試看。": "Mm... I'll give it a try.",
      "如果不用出門就好了……": "If only I didn't have to go out...",
      "安靜的時候最舒服了。": "Quiet moments are the most comfortable.",
      "我在旁邊看就很好了。": "I'm fine just watching from the side.",
      "我沒事……只是心跳有點快。": "I'm fine... my heart's just beating a little fast.",
      "有{user}你在的話,我比較不緊張。": "I feel less nervous when you're around, {user}.",
      "沒關係的,我只是需要一點安靜。": "It's okay, I just need a bit of quiet.",
      "被、被摸頭了……": "M-my head got patted...",
      "謝謝你問我,不過我先不了。": "Thanks for asking, but I'll pass for now.",
      "這樣……可以嗎?": "Like this... is that okay?",
      "這樣安靜地待著,剛剛好。": "Sitting quietly like this is just right.",
      "那個……我試試看。": "Um... I'll try."
    },
